{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are on the parabola <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/0/b50ba49988458e285a4ebda604c769d6808e7582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4x^2+7x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />, and the origin is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. What is the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67a8872f3dad306c3eb22e15d0fbbf50603025b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 2\\sqrt5 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 5+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 5+\\sqrt2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 7 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 5\\sqrt2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"488\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4de5aff3a578973a7ac3aa9f84b9ea69e7510c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_A,y_A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />. As <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> lies on the parabola, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0945a3e0ba78fb474f6218b89d8e0ddee96aeca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_A=4x_A^2+7x_A-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" />.\nAs the origin is the midpoint of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/9/b49c4a8fdd43165dd3d978e209c358db77117a2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-x_A,-y_A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" />.\nWe need to choose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fc18a66926b39254d09908f38cf0ab8c24ddb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"10\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> will lie on the parabola as well. In other words, we need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1155044d4cab5631a8ce2db6dcebc68e6127ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-y_A = 4(-x_A)^2 + 7(-x_A) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"235\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/4/9c427e33bd38e90e34efb7c65e3efeef770253c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" />, we get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/2/5b27522eee065a08811a11420ee0fcebf9b16524.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4x_A^2 - 7x_A + 1 = 4(-x_A)^2 + 7(-x_A) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"329\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>This simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/477c3d3402ed8e1f3bd450cb7339cc4be74423a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8x_A^2 - 2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"19\" />, which solves to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c89646128b63c348740f570b6595ee2ec5dba3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_A = \\pm 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Both roots lead to the same pair of points: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69c4a98ec52cd27c71fe63e6c9e5be533dd44bc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1/2,7/2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1027c2cd1c8439d1e1e139870fe9449feca750b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1/2,-7/2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />. Their distance is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90a4ed0685230cbd7bcda27514a672ae77ea20af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{ 1^2 + 7^2 } = \\sqrt{50} = \\boxed{5\\sqrt2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"197\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solution\">Alternate Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c987e7c50f087b4e5d1b36c0d42819bf205144.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_A, y_A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/961bab0b7b753fab09edff3d881ee1dae5e1a521.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_B, y_B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"18\" />, respectively. Since the median of the points lies on the origin, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b3cbca8ebcaabc9e28b944fb1d59e23acad790b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_A + x_B = y_A + y_B = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"184\" height=\"16\" /> and expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b5d8bf233ac75a71f528393fa2e4ed2941b2487.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_A + y_B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"14\" />, we find:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/332d505f905b0df56bda847ab6cb771e9a8ed25f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4x_A^2 + 7x_A - 1 + 4x_B^2 + 7x_B - 1 = 0\\]\" width=\"284\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/d/b0d8ec99843741914f691865bf38b51cdde05739.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4(x_A^2 + x_B^2) + 7(x_A + x_B) = 2\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/d/d5da12f63c06b93e5c90bbcb57627c12a34280ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_A^2 + x_B^2 = \\frac{1}{2}.\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>It also follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/5/de57ba922f38a32b480863389e4f8ffccd8751c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_A + x_B)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"19\" />. Expanding this, we find:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/8/588f3eb919a7f639c0c37137ee37b6a2892b7b00.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_A^2 + 2x_A x_B + x_B^2 = 0\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e864113eedb4a4d33977aa8cb2cfefa220e57a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{2} + 2x_A x_B = 0\\]\" width=\"118\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/7/b374b51e27ff7539c33dcac9f9c0620ccb0573e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_A x_B = -\\frac{1}{4}.\\]\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>To find the distance between the points, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/d/61d18d273d6c872e571f76cf53777232d5c36c79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{(x_A - x_B)^2 + (y_A - y_B)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"211\" height=\"32\" /> must be found. Expanding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab1c48f356a6fba5425864c0919ab1a82b09c88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_A - y_B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"11\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dadbe8da4462f5b9d9a4b745d6a625682cfe1df0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y_A - y_B = 4x_A^2 + 7x_A - 1 - 4x_B^2 - 7x_B + 1\\]\" width=\"336\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/c/dbcc4502200a4616a57fd956c4037550c25bbe0a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 4(x_A^2 - x_B^2) + 7(x_A - x_B)\\]\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e6eb17e122fef3e50b985d3f341fd87e7d489f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 4(x_A + x_B)(x_A - x_B) + 7(x_A - x_B)\\]\" width=\"295\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/0/390303e0446e8287104471c28a97b3f7d47b5544.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 7(x_A - x_B)\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />\nwe find the distance to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cdbd214d6e43d4283321e636d94dc3c31c403ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{50(x_A - x_B)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"123\" height=\"32\" />. Expanding this yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/4/5f478a8767a9ba372d193ba50ff33df6a60a4775.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5\\sqrt{2(x_A^2 + x_B^2 - 2x_A x_B)} = \\boxed{5\\sqrt{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"259\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017203447\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 317/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8195/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.003      1 -total\n 57.95%    7.535      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 39.77%    5.172      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7772:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017203447 and revision id 80086. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}